{#
CalDAV needs no application-side registration — each user authenticates against
their own server with their own app password — so the admin's only decisions are
whether to offer it and whether to pin everyone to one server.

The one thing worth saying that the file providers' tutorials do not: this
panel is for CalDAV servers only. Google and Microsoft calendars arrive on the
mail sign-in grant above, so an admin looking here for "how do I turn on Gmail
calendars" has to be sent back to the mail provider form rather than left
configuring a connection nobody needs.
#}
